## F The MAPMT Diagnostic Software Purpose:

The Endcap Electro Magnetic Calorimeter (EEMC) Multi-Anode Photo Multiplier Tube (MAPMT) diagnostic software has been written to configure the EEMC's MAPMT's runtime parameters. These parameters include box delays, reset delays, trigger latencies, and many more.

