## G The EEMC MAPMT Software Purpose:

The Endcap Electro-Magnetic Calorimeter's (EEMC's) Multi-Anode Photo-Multiplier-Tube (MAPMT) software has been written to synchronously configure the run-time parameters on all 48 MAPMT boxes of the EEMC. The parameters include box delays, reset delays, trigger latencies, and many more.

Files:

